mSYTBridge.lean#L63-L74","doc":"Auxiliary: chain the adjacent `col_strict` over a gap `d`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StandardYoungTableau.row_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StandardYoungTableau.row_lt","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/NumSYTBridge.lean#L57-L61","doc":"**General row strictness**: `T.entry i j1 < T.entry i j2` for `j1 < j2` (cell `(i, j2)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StandardYoungTableau.row_lt_aux","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StandardYoungTableau.row_lt_aux","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/NumSYTBridge.lean#L44-L55","doc":"Auxiliary: chain the adjacent `row_strict` over a gap `d`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}